=== samwise-ignores-cards-not-from-battlefield
title: Samwise cannot return a card that went to the graveyard from hand (discarded) this turn
ref: Samwise the Stouthearted Oracle ("put there from the battlefield this turn")
state:
  humanhand=Thoughtseize
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  aihand=Samwise the Stouthearted;Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
  aibattlefield=Plains;Plains
script:
  p1: cast Thoughtseize -> p2
